   440 |         """
   441 |         Loads and returns a custom generate function, given a model repo.
   442 | 
   443 |         Args:
   444 |             pretrained_model_name_or_path (`str` or `os.PathLike`):
   445 |                  Can be either:
   446 |                     - A string, the *model id* of a pretrained model hosted inside a model repo on huggingface.co.
   447 |                     - A path to a *directory* containing model weights saved using
