  3294 |             # When using PEFT + gradient checkpointing + Trainer we need to make sure the input has requires_grad=True
  3295 |             # we do it also on PEFT: https://github.com/huggingface/peft/blob/85013987aa82aa1af3da1236b6902556ce3e483e/src/peft/peft_model.py#L334
