  3369 |             is_main_process (`bool`, *optional*, defaults to `True`):
  3370 |                 Whether the process calling this is the main process or not. Useful when in distributed training like
  3371 |                 TPUs and need to call this function on all processes. In this case, set `is_main_process=True` only on
  3372 |                 the main process to avoid race conditions.
