  3985 | 
  3986 |                 - `"eager"` (sequential implementation of the experts matrix multiplications).
  3987 |                 - `"batched_mm"` (using [`torch.bmm`](https://pytorch.org/docs/stable/generated/torch.bmm.html)).
  3988 |                 - `"grouped_mm"` (using [`torch.nn.functional.grouped_mm`](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/main/generated/torch.nn.functional.grouped_mm.html)).
  3989 | 
  3990 |                 By default, if the model supports it, `"grouped_mm"` will be used. The default is otherwise the manual `"eager"` implementation.
  3991 | 
  3992 |             > Parameters for big model inference
  3993 | 
  3994 |             dtype (`str` or `torch.dtype`, *optional*, defaults to `"auto"`):
  3995 |                 Override the default `torch_dtype` and load the model under a specific `dtype`. The different options
  3996 |                 are:
