  3999 |                   `dtype`, ignoring the model's `config.dtype` if one exists. If not specified
  4000 |                   - the model will get loaded in `torch.float` (fp32).
  4001 | 
  4002 |                 2. `"auto"` - A `dtype` or `torch_dtype` entry in the `config.json` file of the model will be
