  4009 | 
  4010 |                 <Tip>
  4011 | 
  4012 |                 For some models the `dtype` they were trained in is unknown - you may try to check the model's paper or
  4013 |                 reach out to the authors and ask them to add this information to the model's card and to insert the
  4014 |                 `dtype` or `torch_dtype` entry in `config.json` on the hub.
  4015 | 
  4016 |                 </Tip>
  4017 | 
  4018 |             device_map (`str` or `dict[str, Union[int, str, torch.device]]` or `int` or `torch.device`, *optional*):
  4019 |                 A map that specifies where each submodule should go. It doesn't need to be refined to each
  4020 |                 parameter/buffer name, once a given module name is inside, every submodule of it will be sent to the
