  4078 |                 `output_attentions=True`). Behaves differently depending on whether a `config` is provided or
  4079 |                 automatically loaded:
  4080 | 
  4081 |                     - If a configuration is provided with `config`, `**kwargs` will be directly passed to the
  4082 |                       underlying model's `__init__` method (we assume all relevant updates to the configuration have
