    61 |         Dimension of the RoPE part of each query/key head.
    62 |     v_head_dim (`int`, *optional*):
    63 |         Dimension of each value head. If `None`, defaults to `hidden_size // num_attention_heads`.
    64 |     scale_emb (`int` or `float`, *optional*, defaults to 12):
    65 |         Multiplier applied to input embeddings.
    66 |     scale_depth (`int` or `float`, *optional*, defaults to 1.4):
    67 |         Multiplier for residual connections; the effective scaling is `scale_depth / sqrt(num_hidden_layers)`.
    68 |         If `None`, defaults to `sqrt(num_hidden_layers)` (no-op scaling).
    69 |     dim_model_base (`int`, *optional*, defaults to 256):
    70 |         Base model dimension used to scale logits before the language model head. If `None`,
    71 |         defaults to `hidden_size` (no-op scaling).
