  1136 |         Args:
  1137 |             special_tokens_dict (dictionary *str* to *str*, `tokenizers.AddedToken`, or `Sequence[Union[str, AddedToken]]`):
  1138 |                 Keys should be in the list of predefined special attributes: [`bos_token`, `eos_token`, `unk_token`,
  1139 |                 `sep_token`, `pad_token`, `cls_token`, `mask_token`, `extra_special_tokens`].
