  1734 |                         "'https://huggingface.co/models', make sure you don't have a local directory with the same name. "
  1735 |                         f"Otherwise, make sure '{pretrained_model_name_or_path}' is the correct path to a directory "
  1736 |                         f"containing all relevant files for a {cls.__name__} tokenizer."
