  2640 |                 - `'pt'`: Return PyTorch `torch.Tensor` objects.
  2641 |                 - `'np'`: Return Numpy `np.ndarray` objects.
  2642 |             verbose (`bool`, *optional*, defaults to `True`):
  2643 |                 Whether or not to print more information and warnings.
  2644 |         """
