  3260 |     """
  3261 |     Process all regular parameters (not kwargs parameters) from the function signature.
  3262 | 
  3263 |     Args:
  3264 |         sig (`inspect.Signature`): Function signature
  3265 |         func (`function`): Function the parameters belong to
  3266 |         class_name (`str`): Name of the class
  3267 |         documented_params (`dict`): Dictionary of parameters that are already documented
  3268 |         indent_level (`int`): Indentation level
  3269 |         undocumented_parameters (`list`): List to append undocumented parameters to
