   358 |     The class exposes [`~generation.GenerationMixin.generate`], which can be used for:
   359 |         - *greedy decoding* if `num_beams=1` and `do_sample=False`
   360 |         - *multinomial sampling* if `num_beams=1` and `do_sample=True`
