  2269 |                 passed to generate matching the attributes of `generation_config` will override them. If
  2270 |                 `generation_config` is not provided, the default will be used, which has the following loading
  2271 |                 priority: 1) from the `generation_config.json` model file, if it exists; 2) from the model
  2272 |                 configuration. Please note that unspecified parameters will inherit [`~generation.GenerationConfig`]'s
  2273 |                 default values, whose documentation should be checked to parameterize generation.
