  2280 |                 generation config. If a stopping criteria is passed that is already created with the arguments or a
  2281 |                 generation config an error is thrown. If your stopping criteria depends on the `scores` input, make
  2282 |                 sure you pass `return_dict_in_generate=True, output_scores=True` to `generate`. This feature is
  2283 |                 intended for advanced users.
