  3360 |         **kwargs,
  3361 |     ):
  3362 |         """
  3363 |         Save a model and its configuration file to a directory, so that it can be re-loaded using the
  3364 |         [`~PreTrainedModel.from_pretrained`] class method.
  3365 | 
  3366 |         Arguments:
  3367 |             save_directory (`str` or `os.PathLike`):
  3368 |                 Directory to which to save. Will be created if it doesn't exist.
  3369 |             is_main_process (`bool`, *optional*, defaults to `True`):
  3370 |                 Whether the process calling this is the main process or not. Useful when in distributed training like
  3371 |                 TPUs and need to call this function on all processes. In this case, set `is_main_process=True` only on
  3372 |                 the main process to avoid race conditions.
  3373 |             state_dict (nested dictionary of `torch.Tensor`):
