  1351 |             Attention:
  1352 | 
  1353 |                     A A A C C C C . .
  1354 |                 C   1 1 1 1 1 1 1 0 0
  1355 |                 C   1 1 1 1 1 1 1 0 0
  1356 |                 C   1 1 1 1 1 1 1 0 0
  1357 |                 C   1 1 1 1 1 1 1 0 0
