  1328 |         Args:
  1329 |             token_ids_0: List of IDs for the (possibly already formatted) sequence.
  1330 |             token_ids_1: Unused when `already_has_special_tokens=True`. Must be None in that case.
  1331 |             already_has_special_tokens: Whether the sequence is already formatted with special tokens.
  1332 | 
