  1509 |         r"""
  1510 |         Instantiate a [`~tokenization_utils_base.PreTrainedTokenizerBase`] (or a derived class) from a predefined
  1511 |         tokenizer.
  1512 | 
  1513 |         Args:
  1514 |             pretrained_model_name_or_path (`str` or `os.PathLike`):
  1515 |                 Can be either:
  1516 | 
  1517 |                 - A string, the *model id* of a predefined tokenizer hosted inside a model repo on huggingface.co.
  1518 |                 - A path to a *directory* containing vocabulary files required by the tokenizer, for instance saved
  1519 |                   using the [`~tokenization_utils_base.PreTrainedTokenizerBase.save_pretrained`] method, e.g.,
  1520 |                   `./my_model_directory/`.
