  3009 |         """
  3010 |         Converts a list of dictionaries with `"role"` and `"content"` keys to a list of token
  3011 |         ids. This method is intended for use with chat models, and will read the tokenizer's chat_template attribute to
  3012 |         determine the format and control tokens to use when converting.
  3013 | 
  3014 |         Args:
