  3016 |                 with "role" and "content" keys, representing the chat history so far.
  3017 |             tools (`list[Union[Dict, Callable]]`, *optional*):
  3018 |                 A list of tools (callable functions) that will be accessible to the model. If the template does not
  3019 |                 support function calling, this argument will have no effect. Each tool should be passed as a JSON Schema,
  3020 |                 giving the name, description and argument types for the tool. See our
  3021 |                 [tool use guide](https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/en/chat_extras#passing-tools)
  3022 |                 for more information.
  3023 |             documents (`list[dict[str, str]]`, *optional*):
  3024 |                 A list of dicts representing documents that will be accessible to the model if it is performing RAG
  3025 |                 (retrieval-augmented generation). If the template does not support RAG, this argument will have no
  3026 |                 effect. We recommend that each document should be a dict containing "title" and "text" keys.
