   260 |         **kwargs: Unpack[Florence2ProcessorKwargs],
   261 |     ) -> BatchFeature:
   262 |         r"""
   263 |         Returns:
   264 |             [`BatchFeature`]: A [`BatchFeature`] with the following fields:
   265 | 
   266 |             - **input_ids** -- List of token ids to be fed to a model. Returned when `text` is not `None`.
