   120 |         videos=None,
   121 |         **kwargs,
   122 |     ) -> BatchFeature:
   123 |         r"""
   124 |         Returns:
   125 |             [`BatchFeature`]: A [`BatchFeature`] with the following fields:
   126 | 
   127 |             - **input_ids** -- List of token ids to be fed to a model. Returned when `text` is not `None`.
   128 |             - **attention_mask** -- List of indices specifying which tokens should be attended to by the model (when
