  1852 |     `input_ids` (special case). Only last token logits are needed for generation, and calculating them only for that
  1853 |     token can save memory, which becomes pretty significant for long sequences or large vocabulary size.
  1854 |     """,
  1855 |         "shape": None,
  1856 |     }
  1857 | 
  1858 |     input_ids = {
