  3258 |     def gradient_checkpointing_enable(self, gradient_checkpointing_kwargs=None):
  3259 |         """
  3260 |         Activates gradient checkpointing for the current model.
  3261 | 
  3262 |         We pass the `__call__` method of the modules instead of `forward` because `__call__` attaches all the hooks of
  3263 |         the module. https://discuss.pytorch.org/t/any-different-between-model-input-and-model-forward-input/3690/2
  3264 | 
  3265 |         Args:
  3266 |             gradient_checkpointing_kwargs (dict, *optional*):
