   225 |                             f"`{key}` is found in both `vision_config_dict` and `vision_config` but with different "
   226 |                             f'values. The value `vision_config_dict["{key}"]` will be used instead.'
   227 |                         )
   228 |                     # If inferred from default argument values (just to be super careful)
   229 |                     else:
   230 |                         message = (
   231 |                             f"`vision_config_dict` is provided which will be used to initialize `CLIPVisionConfig`. "
