    96 | 
    97 |         Two layouts (example param shape [N, in, out]):
    98 | 
    99 |         - tensor_idx is None: one stacked [N, in, out] tensor;
   100 |           slice every sharded dim (including axis 0).
   101 |         - tensor_idx given: one [in, out] tensor per expert;
   102 |           return None if this rank does not own that expert, else slice
   103 |           inner dims only. Surviving pieces are stacked by MergeModulelist
   104 |           into this rank's local [n_local, in, out] shard.
   105 |         """
   106 |         source_shape = list(source.shape) if isinstance(source, torch.Tensor) else source.get_shape()
