  1451 |     For example for:
  1452 |     ```python
  1453 |     WeightConverter(
  1454 |         source_patterns=["mlp.experts.*.gate_proj.weight","mlp.experts.*.up_proj.weight"],
  1455 |         target_patterns="mlp.experts.gate_up_proj",
  1456 |         operations=[MergeModulelist(dim=0), Concatenate(dim=1)],
  1457 |     )
