  1459 |     we would have the following collected tensors:
  1460 |     ```python
  1461 |     collected_tensors = {
  1462 |         "mlp.experts.*.gate_proj.weight": [Future, Future, Future, Future, Future, Future, Future, Future],
  1463 |         "mlp.experts.*.up_proj.weight": [Future, Future, Future, Future, Future, Future, Future, Future],
