  1499 |         "model.layers.13.self_attn.o_proj.weight": WeightConverter(
  1500 |             source_patterns=[":qdata", ":scale"],
  1501 |             target_patterns="",
  1502 |             operations=[TorchaoDeserialize()],
  1503 |             collected_tensors={
  1504 |                 ":qdata": [Future],
  1505 |                 ":scale": [Future],
  1506 |             },
  1507 |         ...
  1508 |     }
  1509 |     ```
  1510 | 
  1511 |     """
  1512 |     base_model_prefix = model.base_model_prefix
  1513 |     tp_plan = tp_plan or {}
  1514 |     device_map = load_config.device_map or {"": "cpu"}
  1515 |     hf_quantizer = load_config.hf_quantizer
  1516 |     dtype = load_config.dtype
