  1201 | ) -> Future | Callable:
  1202 |     """Materialize (and optionally shard) a tensor, asynchronously if a thread pool is provided.
  1203 | 
  1204 |     When ``sharding_op`` is given the tensor is sharded (DTensor placement or legacy TP plan);
  1205 |     otherwise it is simply copied to *device*/*dtype*. Without a thread pool a deferred
  1206 |     callable is returned instead of a Future.
