  1273 |     The second op, `Concatenate`, would then rename the fused tensor into the final target name.
  1274 | 
  1275 |     If we want to split `qkv` we would have:
  1276 |     ```python
  1277 |     collected_tensors = {
  1278 |         "attention.qkv.weight": [Future], # here its the full SOURCE keys.
  1279 |     }
  1280 |     ```
