    30 |         """
    31 |         Calculates Portfolio Value at Risk (VaR) using Historical Simulation.
    32 |         Answers: "What is the maximum amount we expect to lose in a single day with 95% confidence?"
    33 |         
    34 |         Args:
    35 |             valuation: Current evaluated state of the portfolio.
